  "figure": {
    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-formula-card\"><header><h3>ordinary-least-squares</h3><span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--derived\" data-provenance=\"derived\">curated formula</span></header><div><pre class=\"lens-tex\">\\begin{aligned}\n\\term{coefficients}{b}&amp;=\\term{moments}{S_{xx}}^{-1}s_{xy},\n&amp;\\term{intercept}{b_0}&amp;=\\bar y-\\sum_j b_j\\bar x_j\\\\\n\\term{sigmaSquared}{\\hat\\sigma^2}&amp;=\\frac{\\term{residualSumSquares}{\\mathrm{RSS}}}{\\term{freedom}{n-p}},\n&amp;\\term{standardErrors}{\\mathrm{se}_j}&amp;=\\sqrt{\\hat\\sigma^2\\,[S_{xx}^{-1}]_{jj}}\\\\\n\\term{tStatistics}{t_j}&amp;=\\frac{b_j}{\\mathrm{se}_j},\n&amp;\\term{rSquared}{R^2}&amp;=1-\\frac{\\mathrm{RSS}}{\\term{totalSumSquares}{\\mathrm{TSS}}}\n\\end{aligned}</pre><p class=\"lens-ascii\">b = Sxx^-1 sxy; b0 = ybar - sum_j b_j xbar_j; sigma2 = RSS/(n-p); se_j = sqrt(sigma2 [Sxx^-1]_jj); t_j = b_j/se_j; R2 = 1 - RSS/TSS. S are centred cross-products of the finite rows; the unit-scaled normal equations are solved by Cholesky, optionally with ridge lambda added to the predictor diagonal. p counts the intercept; the intercept variance is sigma2 (1/n + xbar Sxx^-1 xbar).</p></div><div class=\"lens-symbols\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.ordinary-least-squares-compiled:ordinary-least-squares-finish\" data-value=\"coefficients\">coefficients (intercept first) · output · coefficientsOut</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.ordinary-least-squares-compiled:ordinary-least-squares-means-merge\" data-value=\"moments\">centred moments · intermediate · momentAt</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.ordinary-least-squares-compiled:ordinary-least-squares-finish\" data-value=\"intercept\">intercept · intermediate · intercept</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.ordinary-least-squares-compiled:ordinary-least-squares-finish\" data-value=\"sigmaSquared\">sigmaSquared · intermediate · sigmaSquared</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.ordinary-least-squares-compiled:ordinary-least-squares-finish\" data-value=\"residualSumSquares\">residualSumSquares · intermediate · residualSumSquares</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.ordinary-least-squares-compiled:ordinary-least-squares-finish\" data-value=\"freedom\">residual degrees of freedom · intermediate · freedom</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.ordinary-least-squares-compiled:ordinary-least-squares-finish\" data-value=\"standardErrors\">standardErrors · output · standardErrorsOut</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.ordinary-least-squares-compiled:ordinary-least-squares-finish\" data-value=\"tStatistics\">tStatistics · output · tStatisticsOut</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.ordinary-least-squares-compiled:ordinary-least-squares-finish\" data-value=\"rSquared\">rSquared · output · rSquared</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.ordin